# Fresh GitHub Pages deploy (one-time setup on GitHub):
# 1. Settings > Pages > Source: GitHub Actions
# 2. Settings > Secrets > WEB3FORMS_ACCESS_KEY = your Web3Forms key
# 3. Actions > Deploy to GitHub Pages > Run workflow
#
# Push from scratch:
git checkout --orphan fresh-start
git add .
git commit -m "Initial portfolio for GitHub Pages"
git branch -M main
git push -f origin main
